 /-- **Deterministic space is nondeterministic space**: `SPACE s ⊆ NSPACE s`.
 [AB09, Theorem 4.2, second inclusion]
@@ -115,6 +121,16 @@ all-branch halting is `M`'s halting, the branch space is `M`'s space by
